<title>JAPAN: Japan LDP says seeks to speed up financial reforms.</title>
<headline>Japan LDP says seeks to speed up financial reforms.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's ruling Liberal Democratic Party (LDP) said on Thursday that the party would seek to speed up the implementation of the government's &quot;Big Bang&quot; reform plan to liberalise financial markets.</p>
</text>
